# Treasure Cruise: "Delve (Each card you exile from your graveyard while casting this spell pays for {1})" (CR 702.66a) - only
# the generic part of {7}{U}. Three Thought Scours on Bot1 itself (with a Black Lotus's {U}{U}{U}) leave ten cards in its
# graveyard (the Lotus, three Scours and six milled cards) and no blue mana: the cast is not offered, however many cards could be
# exiled (the refusal). Playing an Island is the positive control: seven cards delved pay the {7}, the Island the {U}, and
# three cards are drawn.

